# API conventions

- Stack: Node.js ≥24, Express 5, ESM (`"type": "module"`). Use npm only.
- Persist nothing: seed JSON under `data/` loads into memory at process start.
- Errors must use `{ error: { code, message } }` (see `sendError` in `src/index.js`).
- When adding or changing routes, update `openapi.yaml` in the same change.
- Tests: Vitest + supertest. Import the default `app` export; do not start a listener in tests.
- Prefer smallest safe diffs. No drive-by refactors.
